TEXT 48 704 Left 2 !.tran 1p 3n
TEXT 48 880 Left 2 ;StrongARM latch comparator. While clk is low, M7-M10 precharge outn, outp, xp and xn to vdd.\nWhen clk rises, M0 turns on, the pair M1-M2 discharges xp and xn at rates set by the inputs,\nand the cross-coupled latch M3-M6 regenerates the difference: inp above inm sends outn low.\nThe inputs are 1 mV apart at a 0.7 V common mode and swap at 1.5 ns, between the two decisions.\nSizes (W/L in um): M0 2/0.13; M1, M2 4/0.13; M3-M6 2/0.13; M7-M10 1/0.13.
